tice right away. Keep explanations concise and student-friendly."},t.LESSON_HOOK_PROMPT={label:"Write a lesson hook",prompt:"I need a lesson hook to engage students on a topic. You can write a message asking teachers for the essential context needed to create an engaging lesson hook. The message should:\n    - Request student age/grade level\n    - Ask about student interests and hobbies\n    - Ask about recent class topics or context\n    - Ask about the specific concept being introduced\n    Use this information to create a relevant, 1-2 minute hook that connects to students' experiences and creates curiosity about the new concept.\n\n    Format the questions as a clear, easy-to-read list",artifactCandidateType:r.AiDiffArtifactType.LESSON_HOOK}},3545:(e,t)=>{"use strict";Object.defineProperty(t,"__esModule",{value:!0}),t.AIF_MATERIALS_MENU=t.AIF_TEACHER_PREP_MENU=t.AIF_LOGISTICS_MENU=t.AIF_PHILOSOPHY_MENU=t.AIF_TEACHER_RESOURCES=t.AIF_LESSON_PLANS=t.AIF_STUDENT_RESOURCES=t.AIF_TECHNICAL_SUPPORT=t.AIF_TEACHER_COMMUNITY=t.AIF_PROFESSIONAL_DEVELOPMENT=t.AIF_TEACHER_PREP=t.AIF_GRADING_PHILOSOPHY=t.AIF_TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENTS=t.AIF_COURSE_PROJECTS=t.AIF_PACING_GUIDE=t.AIF_PREREQUISITES=t.AIF_WHICH_UNITS=t.AIF_PEDAGOGY=void 0,t.AIF_PEDAGOGY={label:"More about Pedagogy",prompt:"What is the underlying pedagogy?"},t.AIF_WHICH_UNITS={label:"Which units should I teach?",prompt:"Which units should I teach?"},t.AIF_PREREQUISITES={label:"Explore Prerequisites",prompt:"Are there prerequisites for this course?"},t.AIF_PACING_GUIDE={label:"Explore Pacing Guide",prompt:"Where is the pacing guide?"},t.AIF_COURSE_PROJECTS={label:"Learn about projects",prompt:"What are the major course projects?"},t.AIF_TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENTS={label:"More about technical requirements",prompt:"What are the technical requirements?"},t.AIF_GRADING_PHILOSOPHY={label:"Learn about grading philosophy",prompt:"What is the grading philosophy for this course?"},t.AIF_TEACHER_PREP={label:"Prepare to teach",prompt